Z||000002||Seanh||06-22-2001||01:04 PM||||Your not alone by a long shot I'm sure!<P>I do, I pat it on the dash and comend it after every race, upon victory of couse  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> If I loose, I ignore it for a while, and then say "Is that all you've got? I though I raised a better Fiero then that"||||reg||12
