Z||000031||artherd||06-23-2001||05:03 AM||||...I'm going to build you up an engine that's all aluminum and makes more power than God...<P>...I'm gonna give you tires I matched with twesers...<P>...I'm going to give you panels underneeth to catch air and diffuse it in back for more downforce...<P><BR>...I'm going to give you a computer that we'll setup together, so you're breathing your best all the time...<P>...I'm gonna give you 13" brakes, and two dimes on which to stop...<P>...I'm gonna give you a coilover HAL and koni suspension *so* precise you'll swear they paved the roads with steel...<P>...I'm gonna give you corners in wooded coastal hills so smooth, so perfectly banked, with perfect lines and we'll ride off into the sunset together...<P><BR>BrawwwaaaaaaAAAAAAAAAAAAAA,<BR>BBBbbbbrrrraaaaaaaaaaAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA,<BR>BbraaaaaAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa.a.a.a.a.a...<BR>AAAAAAaaaaaaaaa.a.a.a.a...<BR>AAAAAAaaaaaaaaaa.a.a.a.  &lt;repeat&gt;<P>Oh hi honey, I didn't see you in the door, sure, I'm coming in for dinner, just one more minuite...  Talking? I dunno, I didn't hear anyone talking...<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
